$ pagen -width 0 output.png --> FAIL
pagen: width and height must be greater than 0: got 0x256

$ pagen -height 0 output.png --> FAIL
pagen: width and height must be greater than 0: got 256x0

$ pagen -block-size 0 output.png --> FAIL
pagen: block size must be greater than 0: got 0

$ pagen -width 4294967295 -height 4294967295 output.png --> FAIL
pagen: dimensions 4294967295x4294967295 are too large: must contain at most 268435456 pixels

$ pagen -width 8192 -height 8192 output.png --> FAIL
pagen: too many blocks: 8192x8192 blocks of size 1 exceeds the limit of 16777216 blocks

$ pagen -seed n output.png --> FAIL
pagen: invalid seed "n": strconv.ParseUint: parsing "n": invalid syntax

$ pagen -colors , output.png --> FAIL
pagen: palette contains an empty color: ","

$ pagen -colors #ff0000,,#00ff00 output.png --> FAIL
pagen: palette contains an empty color: "#ff0000,,#00ff00"

$ pagen -colors #ff00zz output.png --> FAIL
pagen: invalid color "#ff00zz": strconv.ParseUint: parsing "ff00zz": invalid syntax

$ pagen -colors #ff00 output.png --> FAIL
pagen: invalid color "#ff00": must be #rgb, #rrggbb or #rrggbbaa
